{"id": "the-directional-beacon", "ids": "⿱⿰方巳火", "title": "The Directional Beacon", "pronunciation": "sì", "bopomofo": "ㄙˋ", "meaning": "A beacon fire lit at cardinal directions to guide travelers or signal specific locations.", "formation": "phono-semantic", "definitions": [{"zh": "方向烽火，用以指引方位或傳遞特定位置之訊息", "en": "A directional beacon fire used to indicate cardinal directions or communicate specific locations"}, {"zh": "引申為精確定位、明確指向之意", "en": "By extension, precise positioning or clear indication of direction"}, {"zh": "比喻確切的指引或明確的目標", "en": "Metaphorically, definitive guidance or a clear objective"}], "etymology": "In ancient times, when travelers lost their way in vast territories, beacon fires were lit not merely as warnings but as directional guides. The character ⿱⿰方巳火captures this forgotten practice—combining 方 (direction) with 巳 (the sixth earthly branch, indicating southeast) and 火 (fire) to denote flames that spoke in the language of the compass. Such precise cartographic communication deserved its own character, yet somehow slipped through the cracks of written history.", "source": {"work": "《集韻》", "gloss": "息吏切，音似。方向之烽火也。"}, "components": [{"char": "方", "meaning": "square/direction"}, {"char": "巳", "meaning": "巳"}, {"char": "火", "meaning": "fire"}], "examples": [{"text": "夜行者見⿱⿰方巳火於東南，知歸路不遠矣。", "translation": "The night traveler saw the directional beacon in the southeast and knew the path home was not far.", "style": "classical"}, {"text": "現代登山者仍會設置⿱⿰方巳火，以免同伴迷失山中。", "translation": "Modern mountaineers still set up directional beacons to prevent companions from getting lost in the mountains.", "style": "contemporary"}], "related": [{"char": "烽", "pinyin": "fēng", "gloss": "beacon fire, signal fire"}, {"char": "標", "pinyin": "biāo", "gloss": "mark, sign, indicator"}, {"char": "指", "pinyin": "zhǐ", "gloss": "to point, indicate"}], "tags": ["navigation", "fire", "direction", "signaling"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap\");</style>\n<g transform=\"translate(22.76,50.45) scale(0.281873,0.370762) translate(-107.00,834.00) scale(1,-1)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke fill\">\n  <path d=\"M 472 770 Q 506 739 544 700 Q 560 684 580 684 Q 593 684 600 701 Q 607 719 596 756 Q 584 798 467 830 Q 448 834 440 832 Q 433 828 435 811 Q 439 798 472 770 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 514 542 Q 643 563 895 562 Q 919 563 924 573 Q 931 586 911 603 Q 848 646 789 635 Q 576 592 151 534 Q 126 531 144 511 Q 162 495 182 489 Q 207 483 226 489 Q 341 520 470 537 Q 471 538 474 537 L 514 542 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 510 433 Q 528 415 615 398 Q 657 389 656 353 Q 653 343 650 324 Q 625 180 576 113 Q 566 101 551 96 Q 527 89 462 118 Q 422 133 418 126 Q 414 116 432 105 Q 492 69 520 19 Q 526 1 538 -5 Q 551 -9 586 14 Q 640 62 688 241 Q 709 334 734 348 Q 746 354 747 363 Q 748 373 725 399 Q 692 432 642 431 Q 584 435 528 459 C 500 470 484 449 510 433 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 528 459 Q 531 463 534 466 Q 549 476 547 492 Q 540 516 515 542 Q 514 543 514 542 C 493 564 475 567 474 537 Q 481 465 324 257 Q 311 242 298 228 Q 234 162 126 90 Q 119 86 114 81 Q 107 72 118 69 Q 139 63 245 122 Q 270 140 298 162 Q 397 246 493 406 Q 500 421 510 433 L 528 459 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(264.55,51.97) scale(0.323992,0.435942) translate(-243.00,778.00) scale(1,-1)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke fill\">\n  <path d=\"M 613 523 Q 644 646 685 678 Q 703 699 686 718 Q 599 778 542 745 Q 449 711 346 689 C 317 683 315 645 344 651 Q 357 652 375 659 Q 463 678 549 699 Q 571 706 580 697 Q 592 685 589 661 Q 577 588 560 529 C 552 500 605 494 613 523 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 312 443 Q 363 422 414 437 Q